      <VBox>
        <height>8</height>
        <bottomGap>0</bottomGap>
        <Text>
          <style>Frame</style>
          <text>To our daughter Judith Diana Daphne Mailer, from your Dad and Mum.
May this music's counterpoint weave your life's tapestry.</text>
          </Text>
        </VBox>
