        <Text>
          <style>Frame</style>
          <text>To my wonderful, awesome, and loving father, Octavio Vasquez,
from your loving son, Peter.
Thank you dad for your support and example.  May you enjoy and find inspiration in the Goldberg
Variations each time you hear them.</text>
          </Text>
